# Bench artifacts — never committed. These are captures from a specific radio
# on a specific evening, not source. The 2026-08-09 session alone produced
# ~59 MB of them.
#
# Kept on disk deliberately: raw IQ can be re-decoded at any tuning, filter
# width or AGC setting without touching the radio (see audio-workshop-plan.md
# §4e), so a capture stays useful long after the session that made it. The NAS
# dev mirror picks them up; git should not.

# Raw interleaved float32 IQ captures
*.f32

# Demodulated audio
*.wav

# Capture and stepper logs
iq-*.txt
power-log.txt
gain-log.txt
